rives me  to make stupid things so that more  people click to like on them I guess  yeah like just keep going because  otherwise you don't have anything at the  end of it yes I did I did and I yeah I'm  not sure it could be because because I  don't have the arduino ide on this  computer i can't check what's going on  on the board at the moment so it could  be that my Wi-Fi is down it could be  that my power for some reason isn't  working it could be that the LEDs are  shorted it could be a whole load of  different things that are stopping it  from working at the moment and I'm I  have a bit of a curse with this dress in  demos it was literally working an hour  ago in my hotel room it's just one of  those things where you're like oh come  on but yes I did the tweets were working  at Joe's dress is the Twitter account I  will try and get it working again and  like maybe have it out in the hallway or  something and you can come in to eat at  it yep from Stephanie  um I really like rainbows and sparkly  things so for me more rainbows and more  sparkly things it's always better so  that's quite a driving passion for me  and I saw Stephanie show her umbrella  and cascade dress at a talk a while ago  and just was like ah you can wear  rainbows and sparkly things and you know  that was it for me now I want everything  to be lighting up okay shall we call it  thank you so much everybody for coming  [Applause]
 

